  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a historical scene of a family with a parent physically disciplining a child with a paddle, while other children react with fear or distress. The overlaid text reads, \"i grew up in a household where talking back got your ass whooped.\" The overall intent is to humorously or nostalgically reference a past era of strict parenting and corporal punishment, using the visual of physical discipline to reinforce the message. While not explicitly targeting any specific group with hate or abuse, the meme may be harmful by normalizing or romanticizing corporal punishment, which can be seen as endorsing physical violence against children. The intent is to evoke a sense of shared experience or humor through the juxtaposition of the text with the image of a punitive household dynamic, potentially minimizing the trauma associated with such discipline. The meme does not contain overtly abusive, cyberbullying, misogynistic, or propagandistic content, but its normalization of physical punishment can be considered harmful as it may influence perceptions of appropriate child-rearing practices.",
